{"q":"421","t":"Maximum XOR of Two Numbers in an Array","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given an integer array <code>nums</code>, return <em>the maximum result of </em><code>nums[i] XOR nums[j]</code>, where <code>0 &lt;= i &lt;= j &lt; n</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [3,10,5,25,2,8]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 28\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The maximum result is 5 XOR 25 = 28.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [14,70,53,83,49,91,36,80,92,51,66,70]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 127\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 2 * 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 2<sup>31</sup> - 1</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"findMaximumXOR\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"Bit Manipulation","slug":"bit-manipulation"},{"name":"Trie","slug":"trie"}],"s":[{"t":"Maximum XOR With an Element From Array","s":"maximum-xor-with-an-element-from-array","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Maximum XOR After Operations ","s":"maximum-xor-after-operations","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Sum of Prefix Scores of Strings","s":"sum-of-prefix-scores-of-strings","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Minimize XOR","s":"minimize-xor","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Strong Pair XOR I","s":"maximum-strong-pair-xor-i","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Strong Pair XOR II","s":"maximum-strong-pair-xor-ii","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"]]}